  "details": "I'm not sure how feasible it is, but I have always loved and preferred the legacy option to calibrate into full body over the \"newer\" system.\nIt seems that it was removed finally in the newest BETA\nI really tried to force myself to use the newer calibration method for months but could never get it quite right. \nI don't know if it would be possible, but having the legacy option as a button would be great instead of the now dead Steam launch parameter.",
